      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{59f999485593a546a5eb45b1|full_name}:  It's far more costly for everyone to put a Directional Light on their avatar, that's the issue here. You get a public avatar with a Directional Light and everyone copies it, then my fps just tanks.",
      "viewerReactions": null
