      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "An example where the depth buffer is useful, and an example of a hack that people are using that reduces performance for everyone to get it to work:\n\nContact Shader for VRChat\nhttps://gumroad.com/l/shAGN\n`5. Enable the Depth buffer ( For VRChat: Add a low intensity (0.01), shadow-casting (hard-shadows are cheaper), masked (to an unused layer), directional light to the character.`",
