      "value": "So for this I'd wanna throw this as a suggestion: make a dedicated depth texture via command buffers. there are situations where you'd want to let the _CameraDepthTexture be left alone for assets that use dedicated light sources for some input. having a _VRCDepthTexture that forces depth all the time would be better in most cases where you don't want a dedicated light source in the scene that would eat up performace.",
