      "value": "@{5fcd676570b59138e6ef0271|full_name} The depth texture is a rendertexture captured somewhere within the frame buffer *(outputs the depth pass pixel data present on depth-valid surfaces),* like a grabpass this costs to exist and should not always be on, it should only be on when in use.  You also shouldn't make duplicates, use the one that may or may not already be used in a given world, and none other.",
