      "value": "@{5fcd676570b59138e6ef0271|full_name} If anything generating a new depth texture would be more expensive and more breaking.  All this is for is to eliminate the need to use a shadowed pixel light to force on the depth texture.  Depth texture is a global variable that is used in a vast array of shaders and should remain unchanged.",
